  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "sentence": "Since all terms are positive, we can interchange the order of summation (by Tonelli's theorem): $$\n\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} f(k) = \\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{j^k}\n$$",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
