    "sentence": "For each fixed $ j \\geq 2 $, consider: $$\n\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{j^k}\n$$",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "sentence": "This is a geometric series with first term $ \\frac{1}{j^2} $ and common ratio $ \\frac{1}{j} $: $$\n\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{j^k} = \\frac{\\frac{1}{j^2}}{1 - \\frac{1}{j}} = \\frac{1/j^2}{(j - 1)/j} = \\frac{1}{j(j - 1)}\n$$",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
