  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "sentence": "### Step 3: Final expression",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "sentence": "So the total sum becomes: $$\n\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j(j - 1)}\n$$",
