  {
    "index": 12,
    "sentence": "### Step 4: Telescoping sum",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Plan"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "sentence": "We use the identity: $$\n\\frac{1}{j(j - 1)} = \\frac{1}{j - 1} - \\frac{1}{j}\n$$",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Analyze"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "sentence": "So the sum becomes: $$\n\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\left( \\frac{1}{j - 1} - \\frac{1}{j} \\right)\n$$",
